@startuml ISU_Infirmary_Activity_Restock
!include style.iuml
title Activity Diagram — Restock Requisition

|Nurse|
start
:See low / out-of-stock alert\non Stock & supplies;
:Create restock requisition\n(items, quantities, reasons);
|System|
:Save request as **Pending**;
:Show pending count to the Administrator;
|Administrator|
:Open **Stock requests** and review;
if (Approve?) then (no)
  :Deny with a reason;
  |System|
  :Mark request **Denied**;
  |Nurse|
  :See the admin response;
  stop
else (yes)
  |Administrator|
  :Adjust approved quantities if needed;
  :Press **Approve request**;
  |System|
  :Mark request **Approved**\n(awaiting delivery);
endif
|Nurse|
:Delivery arrives at the clinic;
:Press **Confirm delivery**;
|System|
:Add approved quantities to stock,\nwrite "restocked" ledger rows,\nmark request **Completed**\n(one transaction);
:Update stock status\n(High / Low / Out of stock);
stop
@enduml
